WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 14=

02:03.680 --> 02:05.150
(To my esteemed father:)

02:05.870 --> 02:07.000
(I came to the capital to study,)

02:07.870 --> 02:09.080
(hoping to make a name for myself.)

02:11.000 --> 02:12.800
(But I met a wonderful woman,)

02:14.750 --> 02:15.840
(and we fell in love.)

02:18.750 --> 02:19.520
(I have no desire)

02:20.680 --> 02:21.590
(to join noble clans.)

02:22.960 --> 02:23.960
(A simple life with her)

02:24.840 --> 02:25.710
(would be sweeter than honey.)

02:26.870 --> 02:28.080
(If I make the list one day,)

02:28.430 --> 02:30.190
(I'll do my best to bring honor)

02:30.680 --> 02:31.520
(to our family.)

02:32.030 --> 02:34.430
(All I want is to marry
the woman I love.)

03:31.520 --> 03:32.470
What's wrong?

03:32.870 --> 03:34.099
Don't... don't yell.

03:34.141 --> 03:35.451
I... I'm scared!

03:35.910 --> 03:36.560
Get out!

03:37.080 --> 03:37.750
Get out!

03:37.870 --> 03:38.310
Get out!

03:38.430 --> 03:38.819
I'm leaving!

03:38.861 --> 03:39.301
Get out!

03:39.560 --> 03:40.680
- Get out!
- I need my shoes!

03:41.310 --> 03:42.259
- Get out!
- I...

03:42.301 --> 03:43.021
- Get out!
- Fine, I'll go barefoot!

03:43.840 --> 03:45.240
As if I forced you into this.

03:45.680 --> 03:47.000
Let your family explain it to you.

03:47.680 --> 03:48.400
Get out!

03:48.750 --> 03:49.430
I'm going!

03:49.590 --> 03:50.590
Get out!

04:14.560 --> 04:15.190
Chunhua.

04:15.560 --> 04:16.720
Chunhua, stop crying.

04:17.160 --> 04:18.870
The Prince of Jin really likes you.

04:19.600 --> 04:20.040
Chunhua,

04:20.360 --> 04:21.630
I know you're upset.

04:22.070 --> 04:24.000
But this is a once-in-a-lifetime chance!

04:25.120 --> 04:26.720
I just want you to marry well.

04:27.390 --> 04:28.190
To be blunt,

04:29.000 --> 04:30.870
even if you want to be a maid,

04:31.070 --> 04:31.849
your brother can't spend

04:31.891 --> 04:33.651
his whole life hunting.

04:33.830 --> 04:34.809
Chunhua, listen to me...

04:34.851 --> 04:35.411
Get out!

04:35.800 --> 04:36.830
Get out!

04:37.510 --> 04:39.169
- Get out!
- Chunhua, hear me out...

04:39.211 --> 04:40.381
Don't touch me!

04:40.720 --> 04:41.289
Get out!

04:41.331 --> 04:42.029
Quick! Let's go, Mother!

04:42.071 --> 04:42.594
Get out!

04:42.636 --> 04:43.106
All right...

04:43.430 --> 04:44.630
Get out!

05:08.270 --> 05:08.750
Your Highness,

05:09.070 --> 05:10.830
I didn't expect her
to react so strongly.

05:11.680 --> 05:12.289
I'm sorry.

05:12.331 --> 05:12.771
Your Highness,

05:13.680 --> 05:15.190
Chunhua will come around.

05:15.560 --> 05:16.160
Yes, of course.

05:16.240 --> 05:16.950
Please, calm down.

05:17.430 --> 05:18.190
Have some more to drink.

05:18.270 --> 05:18.750
Yes.

05:19.310 --> 05:19.720
Chunhua.

05:20.750 --> 05:21.160
Chunhua!

05:22.040 --> 05:22.560
Chunhua!

05:23.310 --> 05:24.190
Where are you going?

05:24.750 --> 05:25.750
The Prince of Jin is still here!

05:28.240 --> 05:29.560
What a mess!

05:49.490 --> 05:52.890
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

05:53.220 --> 05:57.320
♪And break a heart that bears no blame?♪

05:57.860 --> 06:01.850
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

06:01.900 --> 06:05.620
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

06:06.420 --> 06:09.060
♪I've tasted the ache
of wanting in vain♪

06:09.690 --> 06:14.020
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds
heavy with rain♪

06:14.490 --> 06:18.490
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

06:18.540 --> 06:21.740
♪What can I do,
with no one to light the way?♪

06:22.430 --> 06:22.920
Chunhua!

06:25.720 --> 06:26.190
Your Highness...

06:27.040 --> 06:27.600
Save me...

06:27.830 --> 06:28.360
Chunhua!

06:30.480 --> 06:31.920
I pushed them away and ran.

06:34.360 --> 06:35.190
The whole way,

06:36.720 --> 06:37.720
all I could do was run.

06:39.390 --> 06:41.240
My whole body felt numb.

06:42.870 --> 06:44.240
My legs didn't feel like my own.

06:45.310 --> 06:46.920
Neither did my arms.

06:48.190 --> 06:48.560
I...

06:53.000 --> 06:53.600
Chunhua.

06:54.800 --> 06:55.560
It's all right.

06:56.480 --> 06:57.190
You're back.

06:58.510 --> 06:59.720
You're back with me now.

07:02.560 --> 07:03.240
It's all right.

07:03.720 --> 07:04.310
Your Highness,

07:05.870 --> 07:06.750
I don't understand.

07:08.600 --> 07:10.480
They're my family.

07:11.720 --> 07:13.920
Why would they hurt me like that?

07:33.430 --> 07:33.950
Forget it.

07:36.720 --> 07:37.560
From now on,

07:39.310 --> 07:41.600
I'll consider my ties with them severed.

07:43.360 --> 07:44.480
That place

07:46.750 --> 07:48.600
is no longer my home.

07:50.360 --> 07:51.630
My home is here.

07:54.240 --> 07:55.430
I still have you, Your Highness.

07:56.360 --> 07:57.190
You still have me.

08:09.040 --> 08:09.870
Then promise me.

08:10.480 --> 08:11.390
You won't do anything foolish.

08:13.390 --> 08:14.070
Don't grieve or hurt yourself

08:15.310 --> 08:16.920
over those people.

08:17.680 --> 08:18.270
They're not worth it.

08:20.160 --> 08:20.830
Promise me.

08:27.240 --> 08:27.830
For the next few days,

08:29.720 --> 08:30.800
you can sleep in my room.

08:31.600 --> 08:32.480
Get some proper rest.

08:34.030 --> 08:35.000
Don't worry about anything.

08:35.510 --> 08:36.270
I'll stay with you.

08:38.360 --> 08:39.200
And you'll stay with me.

08:40.600 --> 08:41.080
All right?

09:43.870 --> 09:44.270
Your Highness,

09:44.720 --> 09:45.240
did you need me?

09:49.000 --> 09:49.360
Your Highness,

09:50.480 --> 09:51.270
how is Chunhua?

09:52.240 --> 09:53.440
She only just fell asleep.

09:55.120 --> 09:56.120
She cries even in her sleep.

10:02.840 --> 10:04.320
Take this letter to the Prince of Jin.

10:04.630 --> 10:05.480
Avoid the Princess Consort.

10:05.840 --> 10:06.910
Make sure it reaches him himself.

10:08.000 --> 10:08.550
Take this letter

10:09.270 --> 10:10.150
to Chunhua's family.

10:11.000 --> 10:11.910
If they can't read,

10:12.510 --> 10:13.420
read it aloud to them.

10:13.420 --> 10:14.260
(Tomorrow, your daughter
will be married to the Prince of Jin.)

10:15.140 --> 10:15.780
Your Highness,

10:16.600 --> 10:18.030
you're hosting a banquet
at Chunhua's home tomorrow

10:18.240 --> 10:19.120
and inviting the Prince of Jin

10:19.550 --> 10:20.510
to arrange the marriage yourself?

10:20.790 --> 10:21.080
Well...

10:21.240 --> 10:21.960
Just deliver the letters.

10:25.200 --> 10:25.510
Understood.

10:27.540 --> 10:32.380
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

11:20.060 --> 11:23.220
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

11:23.560 --> 11:27.860
♪And break a heart that bears no blame?♪

11:28.260 --> 11:32.190
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

11:32.240 --> 11:35.710
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

11:36.520 --> 11:39.690
♪I've tasted the ache
of wanting in vain♪

11:41.510 --> 11:42.720
Liu Wenji came by today.

11:43.840 --> 11:46.550
He stood outside like a fool all day.

11:47.360 --> 11:48.630
He only left at curfew.

11:50.510 --> 11:51.670
If he comes again tomorrow,

11:53.750 --> 11:54.630
would you like to see him?

11:54.672 --> 11:58.642
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave♪

11:59.250 --> 12:02.650
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

12:02.700 --> 12:04.580
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

12:04.630 --> 12:05.360
I'm like this...

12:05.402 --> 12:07.322
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

12:07.440 --> 12:08.240
How can I face him?

12:10.270 --> 12:10.840
Chunhua,

12:12.510 --> 12:13.270
listen to me.

12:14.550 --> 12:15.960
What happened wasn't your fault.

12:17.440 --> 12:19.440
Think of it as being bitten
by a mangy dog

12:19.750 --> 12:20.630
or getting splattered with mud.

12:22.360 --> 12:23.840
Didn't I wash it all off you?

12:23.950 --> 12:26.890
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

12:27.600 --> 12:28.550
My Chunhua

12:29.150 --> 12:30.550
is still as adorable as ever.

12:31.510 --> 12:32.270
Just as beautiful.

12:39.480 --> 12:40.120
But I...

12:42.030 --> 12:42.630
I've already...

12:42.790 --> 12:43.360
Chunhua.

12:44.720 --> 12:45.720
You're still the same person.

12:48.240 --> 12:49.670
Never turn against yourself.

12:50.840 --> 12:52.080
And never punish yourself.

12:55.090 --> 12:59.060
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

12:59.110 --> 13:02.580
♪One moment too late,
love slips from sight♪

13:03.690 --> 13:06.290
♪I've tasted the ache
of wanting in vain♪

13:07.090 --> 13:11.220
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds
heavy with rain♪

13:11.720 --> 13:12.200
Your Highness...

13:12.242 --> 13:15.632
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

13:16.270 --> 13:17.790
I never understood before

13:19.670 --> 13:20.910
how much pain you were in.

13:23.870 --> 13:25.200
But now I do.

13:26.100 --> 13:28.690
♪One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

13:30.360 --> 13:31.510
It really hurts.

13:31.840 --> 13:34.110
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

13:34.600 --> 13:37.490
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

13:38.060 --> 13:42.290
♪Ask not why longing has no end♪

13:42.560 --> 13:45.490
♪I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

13:46.120 --> 13:48.340
♪May we lay sorrow down,
then sleep apart in peace♪

13:48.390 --> 13:50.800
♪Each guarding silence
through the years♪

13:50.850 --> 13:53.890
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

14:04.080 --> 14:05.240
You're heading out this early?

14:05.440 --> 14:05.960
Come with me.

14:06.200 --> 14:06.840
I'll explain on the way.

14:17.270 --> 14:18.480
If Wenji finds out...

14:19.390 --> 14:20.240
Without Chunhua's agreement,

14:21.480 --> 14:23.550
not a word of this must reach Liu Wenji!

14:29.440 --> 14:30.600
Your Highness is bringing a blade.

14:31.030 --> 14:31.840
Is it to intimidate them,

14:32.510 --> 14:33.670
or do you intend to draw blood?

14:34.870 --> 14:35.750
The Prince of Jin deserves to die.

14:37.360 --> 14:38.320
Chunhua's family

14:39.030 --> 14:40.150
are worse than beasts.

14:41.870 --> 14:43.440
I won't let them get away.

14:46.630 --> 14:47.000
All right.

14:48.390 --> 14:49.480
Whatever you plan to do,

14:49.960 --> 14:51.080
I'll go with you.

14:51.790 --> 14:52.870
I know what you're worried about.

14:54.840 --> 14:55.360
Don't worry.

14:57.000 --> 14:58.440
I'll spare that beast's life.

15:21.000 --> 15:21.750
These refugees

15:22.960 --> 15:25.320
were likely driven from their homes

15:25.720 --> 15:26.600
by the Shence Army.

15:29.150 --> 15:30.480
Yu Cheng'an's hunting grounds

15:31.150 --> 15:33.000
may be far larger than we thought.

15:33.440 --> 15:34.840
Thousands of households are affected.

15:35.320 --> 15:36.910
His senior palace attendant, Zheng Xing,

15:37.630 --> 15:38.960
pledged to him

15:39.360 --> 15:42.000
to clear all farmland and homes
within three months.

15:42.600 --> 15:43.870
It's already cost many lives.

15:44.270 --> 15:46.080
Yu Cheng'an has always acted this way.

15:47.080 --> 15:48.670
He never cares who lives or dies.

15:51.600 --> 15:52.630
Even in peacetime,

15:53.080 --> 15:54.440
people can barely make ends meet.

15:55.150 --> 15:57.000
Now they're losing even their homes.

15:58.150 --> 15:59.390
If this continues,

16:00.270 --> 16:01.390
there'll be serious trouble.

16:19.480 --> 16:19.960
Your Highness,

16:20.270 --> 16:22.670
we have nothing better

16:23.270 --> 16:24.200
to offer.

16:24.440 --> 16:26.240
Please, make do with this tea.

16:27.750 --> 16:28.600
My sister-in-law

16:29.000 --> 16:30.369
never brought back some decent tea

16:30.411 --> 16:31.931
from the Princess's place.

16:33.790 --> 16:34.720
Today,

16:35.150 --> 16:36.390
is Princess Danyang coming alone,

16:37.270 --> 16:39.320
or will Chunhua come too?

16:40.440 --> 16:41.150
Your Highness,

16:41.750 --> 16:43.750
the letter only said
the Princess would come.

16:44.320 --> 16:45.510
It didn't mention Chunhua.

16:46.790 --> 16:49.790
That girl is probably hiding
at the Princess's place,

16:50.480 --> 16:51.240
too shy to show her face.

16:52.550 --> 16:53.270
Exactly.

16:53.790 --> 16:55.360
She's been at the Princess's side,

16:55.630 --> 16:57.550
so she thinks she's nobility now.

16:57.630 --> 16:58.270
Putting on airs.

16:59.270 --> 16:59.600
Shut up!

17:03.030 --> 17:05.510
Your Highness, my... my wife means

17:05.720 --> 17:07.640
that with your favor,

17:08.000 --> 17:10.440
Chunhua feels like
someone of high standing.

17:12.440 --> 17:12.830
Your Highness,

17:13.720 --> 17:15.529
when do you plan

17:15.571 --> 17:16.981
to bring Chunhua over?

17:22.110 --> 17:24.550
That depends on
whether she knows her place

17:24.920 --> 17:27.160
and knows how to please me.

17:28.240 --> 17:29.160
Wildflowers are lovely,

17:29.960 --> 17:32.200
but there's no shortage of them.

17:33.880 --> 17:34.400
Your Highness,

17:34.680 --> 17:36.270
our flower has always been

17:36.640 --> 17:39.510
so thoughtful and understanding.

17:39.680 --> 17:41.000
Exactly!

17:45.790 --> 17:46.830
That's enough.

17:47.750 --> 17:48.750
I can't stomach it.

17:49.830 --> 17:50.750
It's awful!

17:59.200 --> 17:59.480
Wan...

18:00.000 --> 18:00.830
Wanyao, you're here.

18:01.880 --> 18:02.920
Is she Princess Danyang?

18:04.790 --> 18:05.480
Your Highness.

18:06.440 --> 18:06.769
Your Highness.

18:06.811 --> 18:07.371
Greetings.

18:09.240 --> 18:10.550
Now that everyone's here,

18:11.070 --> 18:11.790
wonderful.

18:19.790 --> 18:20.400
Don't bother looking.

18:20.720 --> 18:21.400
Chunhua isn't coming.

18:21.830 --> 18:23.070
She's cut ties

18:23.590 --> 18:24.640
with your entire family.

18:25.590 --> 18:27.720
I'm here to settle the score for her.

18:29.400 --> 18:31.769
We're family.
What score is there to settle?

18:31.811 --> 18:32.221
Yes.

18:32.920 --> 18:34.640
Please bring Chunhua here.

18:34.960 --> 18:36.720
We can explain everything to her.

18:41.350 --> 18:41.750
Son!

18:41.920 --> 18:42.769
Are you all right?

18:42.811 --> 18:43.079
I'm fine.

18:43.121 --> 18:43.384
Oh...

18:43.426 --> 18:43.946
I'm fine.

18:44.070 --> 18:46.000
I know you don't understand
what family means.

18:46.960 --> 18:48.270
Even the fiercest beast
won't harm its own young.

18:49.160 --> 18:51.030
As Chunhua's closest family,

18:51.400 --> 18:52.640
you sold her off once

18:53.200 --> 18:54.440
as a servant.

18:54.790 --> 18:55.920
And now you want to sell her again.

18:56.240 --> 18:56.880
Again and again.

18:58.160 --> 18:58.510
Stop right there!

19:04.070 --> 19:04.440
Wan...

19:04.550 --> 19:06.160
Wanyao, I truly love Chunhua.

19:06.510 --> 19:07.219
Look...

19:07.261 --> 19:08.709
What's done is done.

19:08.751 --> 19:10.781
I'm not one
to shirk my responsibilities.

19:11.240 --> 19:13.200
I've been meaning
to discuss this with you.

19:13.440 --> 19:14.979
But... you were busy.

19:15.021 --> 19:15.851
I didn't want to disturb you.

19:15.960 --> 19:17.179
But I...

19:17.221 --> 19:18.499
Even if I can't take her
into my residence,

19:18.541 --> 19:20.434
I can buy her a house elsewhere,

19:20.476 --> 19:22.586
and she can live comfortably.

19:27.480 --> 19:31.640
That hurts!

19:32.720 --> 19:33.680
Listen carefully.

19:34.550 --> 19:36.590
I have Chunhua's indenture.

19:37.160 --> 19:38.590
She's part of my household.

19:39.400 --> 19:40.480
Whether she marries or not,

19:40.680 --> 19:41.510
whether she stays or leaves,

19:41.830 --> 19:42.729
it's up to me.

19:42.771 --> 19:44.909
Yes... It's all up to you!

19:44.951 --> 19:46.104
I... I don't know

19:46.146 --> 19:47.306
why you're so angry.

19:47.440 --> 19:49.619
I thought she's just a maid...

19:49.661 --> 19:52.421
That hurts...

20:04.510 --> 20:05.640
Ti, you know

20:07.160 --> 20:08.590
ever since I returned from North Jing,

20:09.400 --> 20:10.440
I've become a madwoman.

20:11.270 --> 20:13.240
I can't stand the slightest provocation.

20:13.920 --> 20:14.960
I can't think straight.

20:15.400 --> 20:16.680
I just do whatever I feel like.

20:19.790 --> 20:20.310
What...

20:20.720 --> 20:21.640
What do you want to do?

20:21.920 --> 20:23.030
To be honest,

20:24.070 --> 20:27.160
I've been bottling up my anger.

20:27.400 --> 20:28.200
I couldn't take it anymore.

20:29.160 --> 20:30.350
I stabbed you today,

20:31.200 --> 20:31.960
and I feel much better.

20:32.350 --> 20:33.440
As long as you feel better...

20:34.030 --> 20:35.240
I hope you will

20:35.830 --> 20:37.110
keep your distance from Chunhua.

20:37.880 --> 20:39.240
If I catch you again,

20:41.270 --> 20:42.070
my sword

20:43.110 --> 20:44.510
won't miss.

20:52.640 --> 20:53.720
Ti, you've suffered.

20:55.920 --> 20:58.400
These commoners tried
to murder a prince.

20:59.000 --> 20:59.790
What punishment do they deserve?

21:07.960 --> 21:08.590
Come on.

21:09.590 --> 21:11.310
You're a prince.
You left without a scratch,

21:11.440 --> 21:12.440
then came back with a knife wound.

21:12.790 --> 21:14.160
Did you stab yourself?

21:18.160 --> 21:18.480
Yes!

21:19.720 --> 21:20.070
It's them!

21:20.590 --> 21:21.510
They stabbed me!

21:22.750 --> 21:23.240
I...

21:23.550 --> 21:24.750
Attempting to assassinate a prince

21:25.510 --> 21:26.510
means exile at best,

21:27.110 --> 21:28.070
execution at worst.

21:29.070 --> 21:30.000
Since you're the victim, Ti,

21:30.920 --> 21:32.000
you can press charges yourself.

21:33.680 --> 21:35.059
- We're innocent!
- I'll go!

21:35.101 --> 21:35.634
No!

21:35.676 --> 21:37.637
We're innocent!

21:37.679 --> 21:38.748
- We're innocent!
- We didn't kill anyone!

21:38.790 --> 21:39.239
I don't want to die!

21:39.281 --> 21:40.721
- Chunhua suffered far worse!
- I don't want to die!

21:44.350 --> 21:44.790
Wanyao...

21:45.790 --> 21:46.920
Can I leave now?

21:47.750 --> 21:48.920
I'm bleeding...

21:51.680 --> 21:52.459
You can't leave, Your Highness!

21:52.501 --> 21:53.389
Your Highness!

21:53.431 --> 21:53.861
Your Highness!

21:53.960 --> 21:55.331
- You can't leave, Your Highness!
- Don't go!

21:55.440 --> 21:57.499
- Your Highness, help us!
- What will we do without you?

21:57.541 --> 21:58.994
- Come back, Your Highness!
- Please save us!

21:59.036 --> 22:00.716
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

22:04.160 --> 22:04.640
(Come out at once!)

22:05.240 --> 22:05.750
(Hurry!)

22:06.200 --> 22:06.510
(Quick!)

22:07.680 --> 22:09.640
What's going on?

22:11.400 --> 22:12.030
The Shence Army?

22:13.000 --> 22:13.830
What are they doing here?

22:15.030 --> 22:15.510
Your Highness,

22:16.790 --> 22:17.400
the Shence Army's here.

22:23.160 --> 22:24.000
Has your land also been marked

22:24.240 --> 22:25.270
for the hunting grounds?

22:28.200 --> 22:28.720
Answer him!

22:29.240 --> 22:30.240
Y-Yes!

22:31.510 --> 22:33.030
Your Highness...

22:33.310 --> 22:34.699
That hurts!

22:34.741 --> 22:35.131
Your Highness,

22:35.350 --> 22:37.240
you must protect my family!

22:37.350 --> 22:37.640
I...

22:39.920 --> 22:40.680
Your Highness.

22:41.000 --> 22:42.750
Three months ago, an official said

22:42.830 --> 22:44.920
our entire village'd become
hunting grounds.

22:45.110 --> 22:46.899
My whole family entirely depends

22:46.941 --> 22:48.701
on this land and these mountains.

22:49.240 --> 22:51.030
We really have no other choice!

22:52.350 --> 22:52.790
Your Highness,

22:53.590 --> 22:55.550
now that you've slept with Chunhua,

22:56.000 --> 22:57.400
please, for Chunhua's sake,

22:57.550 --> 22:59.289
you... you must save our family!

22:59.331 --> 22:59.779
Your Highness!

22:59.821 --> 23:01.064
- Your Highness!
- Save us!

23:01.106 --> 23:02.276
- Please save us!
- That hurts!

23:02.640 --> 23:03.880
So this is why

23:04.240 --> 23:04.960
you sold Chunhua off?

23:06.310 --> 23:06.920
Your Highness...

23:07.110 --> 23:08.590
Your Highness,
tell them that's not true.

23:09.160 --> 23:10.070
Cut the crap!

23:10.550 --> 23:11.510
What's wrong with you?

23:12.110 --> 23:13.310
I'm bleeding!

23:13.590 --> 23:14.880
Use your heads!

23:15.590 --> 23:16.790
Who... who would dare stop

23:17.160 --> 23:18.000
the man building hunting grounds?

23:19.000 --> 23:20.270
Just wait until you're exiled!

23:21.160 --> 23:22.070
I'm leaving.

23:22.440 --> 23:23.489
Wanyao, I'm off.

23:23.531 --> 23:25.021
- I'm going home for dinner...
- Your Highness!

23:25.110 --> 23:25.809
Your Highness, hear me out!

23:25.851 --> 23:27.421
You can't leave, Your Highness...

23:30.440 --> 23:30.920
Your Highness!

23:31.160 --> 23:32.769
Your Highness,
you care for Chunhua the most.

23:32.811 --> 23:34.091
Please, save our family!

23:34.270 --> 23:35.830
Your Highness!

23:42.070 --> 23:44.830
Search every inch of this place.

23:45.110 --> 23:46.249
Leave no one behind.

23:46.291 --> 23:47.131
Tie them all up!

23:47.640 --> 23:48.440
Line them up!

23:49.960 --> 23:50.400
Sir,

23:51.270 --> 23:52.640
looks like he's running away!

23:54.880 --> 23:57.000
It's been ages
since I stretched my arms.

24:04.640 --> 24:05.400
Go check on him.

24:05.510 --> 24:05.859
Yes, sir!

24:05.901 --> 24:07.851
Let's see who dares pull this stunt.

24:12.200 --> 24:12.640
Run!

24:13.030 --> 24:13.750
Where are you running to?

24:14.750 --> 24:15.920
What scoundrel are you?

24:16.590 --> 24:18.030
How dare you shoot me!

24:18.480 --> 24:19.830
I'm the Prince of Jin!

24:21.550 --> 24:22.750
Oh, you're the Prince of Jin?

24:29.200 --> 24:29.960
Reporting.

24:30.680 --> 24:32.200
That man claims he's

24:32.790 --> 24:33.240
Prince of Jin.

24:41.680 --> 24:43.000
Everyone thinks they can bully me!

24:43.790 --> 24:44.158
(Oh, no!)

24:44.200 --> 24:45.110
Even a eunuch dares bully me!

24:45.152 --> 24:46.072
(He really is the Prince of Jin!)

24:46.590 --> 24:48.068
(What is he doing here?)

24:48.110 --> 24:50.680
I'll make the Emperor give me justice!

24:50.920 --> 24:51.400
Sir,

24:52.440 --> 24:54.270
could he really be the Prince of Jin?

24:54.680 --> 24:56.270
Today's just not my day.

24:57.590 --> 24:59.400
If he makes a fuss about this,

24:59.960 --> 25:01.510
and my godfather finds out,

25:02.350 --> 25:04.110
he'll never let me off easy.

25:04.510 --> 25:07.920
My whole future will be ruined.

25:10.880 --> 25:12.640
I say, since we're
in the middle of nowhere,

25:12.750 --> 25:13.240
we should...

25:21.550 --> 25:23.590
Burn his body too.

25:23.750 --> 25:25.030
Leave no trace behind.

25:25.350 --> 25:25.680
Got it.

25:26.590 --> 25:26.920
Move!

25:33.070 --> 25:35.110
Are you taking me back to the palace?

25:35.270 --> 25:37.350
I... I can walk on my own!

25:38.270 --> 25:39.200
Mr. Zheng,

25:39.680 --> 25:41.489
please, have mercy!

25:41.531 --> 25:41.901
Sir,

25:42.440 --> 25:44.030
there are homes all around us.

25:44.310 --> 25:45.550
Someone might see it.

25:49.680 --> 25:50.920
Let's kill

25:51.270 --> 25:52.680
every last witness.

25:53.350 --> 25:53.640
Got it.

25:54.680 --> 25:54.960
Move!

25:58.110 --> 25:59.720
They're determined to silence everyone.

26:00.400 --> 26:00.790
Your Highness,

26:01.400 --> 26:02.440
I'll get you and Mr. Yan out of here.

26:03.240 --> 26:05.000
With this many troops,
I doubt we can make it.

26:05.720 --> 26:06.160
Fang Tong,

26:07.310 --> 26:08.550
however mighty you are,

26:09.000 --> 26:10.270
you can't beat this many soldiers.

26:11.750 --> 26:12.400
If we fight our way out,

26:13.000 --> 26:14.110
all three of us will die here.

26:14.720 --> 26:15.350
Then what do we do?

26:16.160 --> 26:17.200
I shouldn't have agreed

26:17.720 --> 26:18.400
to bring you here.

26:18.640 --> 26:19.920
Now's no time for that!

26:21.550 --> 26:22.070
Right now,

26:23.310 --> 26:24.440
there may be only one way.

26:27.270 --> 26:27.680
Yan Shang,

26:30.000 --> 26:30.590
do you remember

26:31.440 --> 26:32.680
that embroidered picture of five fish?

26:34.030 --> 26:34.590
Today,

26:35.030 --> 26:36.030
I'll make the first move.

26:42.160 --> 26:42.720
(Zheng Xing,)

26:43.590 --> 26:44.638
(for the sake
of these people's lives...)

26:44.680 --> 26:45.880
Thoroughly search the place again!

26:45.922 --> 26:47.548
(You must die today!)

26:47.590 --> 26:48.880
Leave no survivors!

26:54.240 --> 26:54.720
Sir!

26:56.640 --> 26:57.070
(Watch out!)

26:57.350 --> 26:57.880
(Stay alert!)

26:59.480 --> 26:59.735
(Sir?)

26:59.800 --> 27:00.220
(Sir?)

27:00.270 --> 27:00.529
Sir?

27:00.571 --> 27:00.941
Sir...

27:03.240 --> 27:04.030
(Don't panic, everyone!)

27:04.880 --> 27:05.350
They're inside the house.

27:06.200 --> 27:06.960
The criminal's in there!

27:07.240 --> 27:08.110
Seize them!

27:08.270 --> 27:08.590
Quick!

27:10.000 --> 27:10.400
Hurry!

27:13.240 --> 27:13.590
(Follow me!)

27:15.350 --> 27:15.920
(Over here!)

27:22.920 --> 27:23.880
(Who's in there?)

27:24.030 --> 27:24.510
(Come out!)

27:37.350 --> 27:38.070
You shot that arrow?

27:39.240 --> 27:39.550
Yes.

27:40.030 --> 27:40.510
It was me.

27:41.790 --> 27:42.240
Yan Shang!

27:46.960 --> 27:48.400
Zheng Xing was ruthless,

27:48.960 --> 27:49.790
preyed on the people.

27:50.200 --> 27:51.160
Killing him today

27:51.880 --> 27:53.070
was justice in Heaven's name.

27:54.480 --> 27:55.070
Very well!

27:55.790 --> 27:56.550
You all heard that?

27:57.400 --> 27:58.640
Seize this criminal!

27:58.790 --> 27:59.920
Avenge Mr. Zheng!

28:00.200 --> 28:00.510
Move!

28:00.790 --> 28:01.590
(Yes, sir!)

28:01.720 --> 28:02.680
I am Princess Danyang!

28:03.160 --> 28:03.920
Who dares to act recklessly?

28:08.640 --> 28:09.480
Zheng Xing is dead.

28:09.830 --> 28:11.200
If you dare lay a hand on me,

28:11.880 --> 28:12.960
do you want to join him in the grave?

28:16.110 --> 28:17.750
Today, I'll see for myself

28:18.480 --> 28:19.880
who dares to harm

28:21.400 --> 28:22.550
a member of the imperial family

28:23.200 --> 28:24.720
and risk having
their entire clan wiped out!

28:29.200 --> 28:29.920
You few,

28:30.350 --> 28:31.510
what rank do you hold?

28:33.270 --> 28:34.270
Raising your weapons against me,

28:34.720 --> 28:35.920
are you attempting to assassinate me?

28:40.160 --> 28:42.400
We failed to recognize Your Highness.

28:42.790 --> 28:43.920
Please forgive us.

28:47.440 --> 28:48.160
However,

28:49.510 --> 28:52.030
this criminal has confessed
to killing Mr. Zheng.

28:52.960 --> 28:54.000
Princess Danyang,

28:54.480 --> 28:55.550
are you trying to shield him?

29:00.880 --> 29:01.350
Your Highness,

29:02.110 --> 29:04.200
I must be the one who killed Zheng Xing.

29:05.270 --> 29:06.160
I can't save you,

29:06.590 --> 29:07.680
but you can save me.

29:09.030 --> 29:09.550
So,

29:10.590 --> 29:11.550
you must stay out of it.

29:13.070 --> 29:14.200
Remember, patience.

29:15.000 --> 29:15.750
That python

29:16.550 --> 29:17.680
has yet to bare its fangs.

29:24.160 --> 29:25.200
Then I'll ask Your Highness

29:26.070 --> 29:26.920
to see me off a little farther.

29:36.270 --> 29:37.000
Officers,

29:37.920 --> 29:38.440
I hereby

29:38.960 --> 29:39.680
turn myself in.

29:41.110 --> 29:41.640
I ask you all

29:42.310 --> 29:43.070
to escort me back

29:43.640 --> 29:44.750
to stand trial.

29:45.480 --> 29:45.830
Take him away!

29:46.550 --> 29:46.960
Yes, sir!

29:47.110 --> 29:47.590
How dare you!

29:49.160 --> 29:50.240
I'll escort him myself.

29:52.550 --> 29:53.480
How dare you lay a hand on him?

30:14.440 --> 30:15.720
Let it be known to all:

30:16.400 --> 30:17.480
I, Yan Shang,

30:18.160 --> 30:19.550
killed Zheng Xing today.

30:20.070 --> 30:22.270
Princess Danyang herself is escorting me

30:23.110 --> 30:24.240
back to the city to surrender!

30:28.030 --> 30:33.070
(Thank you, hero!)

30:33.480 --> 30:33.960
(Thank you!)

30:34.240 --> 30:35.070
I, Yan Shang,

30:35.590 --> 30:37.070
killed Zheng Xing today.

30:37.750 --> 30:40.000
Princess Danyang herself is escorting me

30:40.480 --> 30:41.550
back to the city to surrender!

30:42.590 --> 30:43.590
I, Yan Shang,

30:44.070 --> 30:45.440
killed Zheng Xing today.

30:46.110 --> 30:48.270
Princess Danyang herself is escorting me

30:48.920 --> 30:49.960
back to the city to surrender!

30:51.020 --> 30:55.620
♪I gaze at high peaks
and sails far away♪

30:56.120 --> 30:59.320
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

31:00.290 --> 31:05.320
♪Dusk falls on the horizon,
sorrow and joy stretch far♪

31:05.690 --> 31:08.920
♪A lone lamp keeps me company♪

31:10.260 --> 31:14.890
♪By noon, the mist will lift;
rivers will bend♪

31:16.060 --> 31:18.420
(Well done!)

31:18.590 --> 31:24.719
(Well done!)

31:24.760 --> 31:26.615
(You're our benefactor!)

31:27.820 --> 31:30.315
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

31:30.357 --> 31:32.597
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

31:32.790 --> 31:35.310
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

31:35.510 --> 31:38.310
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

31:38.590 --> 31:44.422
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

31:44.422 --> 31:48.310
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

31:48.310 --> 31:52.198
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

31:52.198 --> 31:58.030
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

31:58.550 --> 32:01.480
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

32:01.590 --> 32:04.750
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

32:05.310 --> 32:08.000
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

32:08.760 --> 32:11.240
(He served justice! He's not guilty!)

32:13.092 --> 32:17.210
♪With the world in my heart,
I leave the shore♪

32:17.252 --> 32:22.282
♪Frost on my shoulders,
joys and sorrows stretch afar♪

32:22.570 --> 32:25.800
♪A thousand miles of lights
keep me company♪

32:27.140 --> 32:31.770
♪By noon, the mist will lift;
rivers will bend♪

32:32.170 --> 32:35.300
♪Today, lean on the rail with me again♪

32:40.700 --> 32:41.540
(By Lord Yu's order,)

32:42.030 --> 32:43.060
(as this case concerns
the hunting grounds,)

32:43.660 --> 32:45.900
(the murder suspect must not
be taken to the Capital Prefecture!)

32:46.540 --> 32:48.790
(The Yintaimen Investigation Office
will handle the case.)

32:49.440 --> 32:49.880
(Take him away!)

32:50.400 --> 32:50.790
(Yes, sir!)

33:25.270 --> 33:27.160
I should've checked my luck.

33:27.240 --> 33:28.310
It hurts like hell...

33:33.240 --> 33:34.550
Wh-why are you coming to me again?

33:35.070 --> 33:36.720
You nearly died
at Zheng Xing's hands today.

33:37.200 --> 33:38.350
Do you know how you survived?

33:39.790 --> 33:42.110
Wanyao, I... passed out from the pain.

33:42.480 --> 33:43.550
I have no idea.

33:44.030 --> 33:46.750
Yan Shang, the Third-Place Scholar,
shot Zheng Xing.

33:46.920 --> 33:47.590
He saved your life.

33:48.640 --> 33:49.160
Now,

33:49.550 --> 33:51.110
he's been sent to
the Yintaimen Investigation Office.

33:53.440 --> 33:54.070
The Investigation Office?

33:55.640 --> 33:57.350
That's no place for a human being.

33:58.160 --> 33:59.550
No one comes out of there unscathed.

34:00.310 --> 34:00.790
Ti,

34:01.400 --> 34:02.640
you must testify in his defense.

34:03.590 --> 34:05.590
Today, Zheng Xing tried to silence you.

34:05.960 --> 34:06.880
Yan Shang was saving you.

34:09.110 --> 34:09.550
No!

34:10.150 --> 34:10.760
My leg...

34:11.590 --> 34:12.710
was hurt by that family.

34:14.630 --> 34:16.000
Zheng Xing had nothing to do with it.

34:16.760 --> 34:17.150
Tomorrow,

34:17.880 --> 34:19.110
I'll have the authorities arrest them

34:19.510 --> 34:20.280
and exile them all!

34:23.000 --> 34:23.480
Wanyao,

34:24.400 --> 34:26.630
if Lord Yu finds out,
there'll be hell to pay.

34:27.320 --> 34:28.800
I advise you to stay out of it, too.

34:29.590 --> 34:31.510
You think Yintaimen care
about right and wrong?

34:32.360 --> 34:33.440
Maybe Yan Shang just wants

34:33.550 --> 34:34.800
to die for a noble cause

34:35.190 --> 34:36.190
and make a name for himself.

34:40.320 --> 34:41.150
You're right.

34:44.110 --> 34:44.710
Your injury

34:45.440 --> 34:46.590
was caused by that family.

34:49.320 --> 34:50.440
Your wife has always been jealous.

34:51.190 --> 34:52.000
If she finds out

34:52.880 --> 34:53.840
you left the city in disguise

34:54.070 --> 34:55.190
just to chase after a woman...

34:56.190 --> 34:56.760
Wanyao,

34:57.440 --> 34:58.590
my dear sister,

35:00.710 --> 35:01.360
since you won't

35:02.030 --> 35:03.110
let me have Chunhua,

35:03.510 --> 35:05.150
this stays between us.

35:05.510 --> 35:07.190
Don't let my wife find out, all right?

35:07.590 --> 35:08.630
If you refuse to testify,

35:09.000 --> 35:10.030
she will definitely find out!

35:10.550 --> 35:10.840
You...

35:15.280 --> 35:16.070
You little brat!

35:16.920 --> 35:18.480
You're truly vicious!

35:19.030 --> 35:20.400
Go tell her, then!

35:21.110 --> 35:22.440
Even if she claws my face off

35:23.280 --> 35:24.400
and tears my hair out,

35:25.440 --> 35:26.710
I still won't testify!

35:28.440 --> 35:30.800
He killed Lord Yu's trusted aide!

35:34.670 --> 35:37.630
That hurts!

35:39.000 --> 35:41.030
Wanyao, I know you're upset.

35:42.070 --> 35:43.440
Go tell her, then!

35:44.960 --> 35:45.590
Hit me if you want!

35:46.630 --> 35:48.840
It's still better than crossing Lord Yu.

35:49.630 --> 35:50.280
Crossing him

35:51.030 --> 35:52.280
is as good as death!

35:53.000 --> 35:53.400
Go on, hit me!

36:03.760 --> 36:04.920
It hurts like hell...

36:13.620 --> 36:14.049
(Virtue Shines)

36:14.091 --> 36:16.211
(Yan Shang's been in the Yintaimen
for two hours.)

36:19.590 --> 36:20.150
(Now,)

36:21.280 --> 36:23.030
(if there's any chance of saving him,)

36:24.440 --> 36:25.590
(only Father can help.)

36:26.360 --> 36:26.840
(Your Highness.)

36:27.440 --> 36:28.590
(Remember, patience.)

36:29.510 --> 36:30.190
(That python)

36:31.030 --> 36:32.150
(has yet to bare its fangs.)

36:34.280 --> 36:36.070
(If I were trapped
in that python's jaws,)

36:36.840 --> 36:37.590
(I could endure it.)

36:38.510 --> 36:39.190
(But Yan Shang...)

36:39.960 --> 36:41.510
(Now you're the one)

36:42.030 --> 36:42.840
(caught in its jaws.)

36:48.760 --> 36:50.259
Since I ascended the throne,

36:50.301 --> 36:52.821
I've pardoned only three people.

36:53.590 --> 36:56.960
And all three had achieved
extraordinary feats.

36:58.320 --> 37:00.150
What has Yan Shang done?

37:00.920 --> 37:01.710
He killed Zheng Xing,

37:02.400 --> 37:03.710
saving countless lives.

37:04.230 --> 37:04.960
It was a righteous deed.

37:08.510 --> 37:10.280
The sages punish the wicked,

37:11.280 --> 37:12.230
save lives and restore order,

37:12.670 --> 37:13.840
and must resort to punishment

37:14.400 --> 37:15.510
to bring peace to the realm.

37:16.230 --> 37:17.320
Yan Shang may not be a sage,

37:18.440 --> 37:19.440
but he's a good man.

37:21.840 --> 37:23.440
There are plenty of good men.

37:25.360 --> 37:25.710
Wanyao,

37:26.440 --> 37:27.590
tell me the truth.

37:28.440 --> 37:31.320
Why make an exception for this man?

37:35.550 --> 37:36.190
You must understand,

37:36.630 --> 37:38.030
once I issue this pardon,

37:38.800 --> 37:39.630
Yu Cheng'an will come here

37:40.360 --> 37:41.230
in no time

37:42.710 --> 37:45.230
and demand an explanation.

37:46.550 --> 37:47.230
Don't kneel.

37:49.070 --> 37:49.630
I understand.

37:51.320 --> 37:52.480
I've let you down.

37:52.820 --> 37:56.100
(Universe in Harmony)

37:56.190 --> 37:56.710
Rise.

38:01.070 --> 38:03.360
Now tell me why.

38:04.440 --> 38:07.360
Even if I issue a hundred pardons

38:07.440 --> 38:08.590
to help you,

38:09.480 --> 38:11.630
Yu Cheng'an wouldn't dare kill me.

38:13.480 --> 38:14.280
All these years,

38:15.800 --> 38:17.440
I've endured his oppression.

38:17.880 --> 38:19.000
So this is no big deal.

38:20.320 --> 38:23.030
I need to know why.

38:24.630 --> 38:26.070
What makes him so special?

38:27.480 --> 38:28.190
So special that,

38:29.630 --> 38:30.819
even knowing the consequences,

38:30.861 --> 38:33.091
you'd still beg me to save him?

38:36.920 --> 38:38.000
He's taking the blame for me.

38:39.760 --> 38:40.880
I killed Zheng Xing.

38:45.360 --> 38:46.550
I see.

38:50.360 --> 38:51.590
His actions make sense.

38:52.550 --> 38:54.070
No wonder you'd risk everything

38:54.920 --> 38:55.960
to clear his name.

38:57.480 --> 38:58.400
Please spare him, Father.

39:01.360 --> 39:01.960
Get up.

39:06.000 --> 39:08.320
Did he take the blame for you willingly?

39:08.880 --> 39:09.280
Yes.

39:11.110 --> 39:11.960
That explains it.

39:13.030 --> 39:14.440
His actions are understandable,

39:14.630 --> 39:15.400
but that doesn't mean

39:15.880 --> 39:17.070
his plight deserves sympathy.

39:17.360 --> 39:17.960
Father!

39:20.150 --> 39:20.800
Wanyao,

39:21.550 --> 39:22.840
you're so determined to protect him.

39:26.760 --> 39:28.510
Is it guilt,

39:29.440 --> 39:30.760
or do you have feelings for him?

39:32.670 --> 39:33.550
I feel guilty.

39:35.590 --> 39:36.550
I've let you down.

39:40.590 --> 39:43.030
If he's the man you love,

39:43.510 --> 39:44.960
I'll issue the pardon right now.

39:46.320 --> 39:48.070
But if he's merely your benefactor,

39:49.280 --> 39:51.230
I'll see that he gets a proper burial.

39:57.550 --> 39:58.510
Gratitude or love,

39:59.880 --> 40:00.760
how can I tell them apart?

40:03.920 --> 40:04.440
Father,

40:07.400 --> 40:08.760
Yan Shang has the talent
to save our state.

40:10.150 --> 40:11.190
Why not spare his life

40:11.960 --> 40:13.030
so he will advise the court

40:13.480 --> 40:14.360
and serve our realm?

40:42.360 --> 40:45.360
(The circumstances invite leniency.
Let leniency be shown.)

41:07.080 --> 41:09.660
(Grant him special pardon. Proclaim it
far and wide, that all may know.)

41:11.510 --> 41:12.190
Thank you, Father!

41:13.070 --> 41:13.710
Rise.

41:21.710 --> 41:22.760
Go save him.

41:24.460 --> 41:27.900
(Universe in Harmony)

41:33.590 --> 41:36.280
Why didn't you tell Princess Danyang

41:37.230 --> 41:39.030
that the people you tried to save

41:39.480 --> 41:40.590
with your past three pardons

41:41.230 --> 41:44.400
all ended up unsaved?

41:47.670 --> 41:49.800
If Yu Cheng'an sees this pardon,

41:50.710 --> 41:53.150
Yan Shang is as good as dead.

41:56.630 --> 41:58.230
Since you think so highly of him,

41:59.400 --> 42:01.190
why not help him yourself?

42:02.000 --> 42:05.230
My pardon could be a death warrant.

42:05.670 --> 42:06.630
But you're different.

42:07.030 --> 42:08.070
Yu Cheng'an will

42:08.190 --> 42:11.280
still show you some respect.

42:12.440 --> 42:12.960
I'm not saving him.

42:15.150 --> 42:16.320
In Go,

42:17.400 --> 42:18.280
you first open a ko,

42:18.800 --> 42:19.590
then fight it,

42:20.360 --> 42:22.000
find a ko threat and answer it,

42:22.230 --> 42:23.150
then fight again.

42:24.070 --> 42:24.760
We've only

42:25.480 --> 42:26.800
just begun the ko fight.

42:27.920 --> 42:29.150
It's far too soon

42:29.800 --> 42:30.760
to settle it.

42:32.190 --> 42:34.110
If it dies now,

42:35.320 --> 42:37.590
it'll just be a useless stone.

42:38.550 --> 42:40.880
(Serene and Content)
Young men lack foresight

42:42.000 --> 42:42.960
and lose their cool.

42:44.150 --> 42:45.630
They've already put themselves

42:47.030 --> 42:49.190
in a dead position.

42:55.480 --> 42:56.800
So how would you

42:57.510 --> 42:58.760
break out of it?

42:59.920 --> 43:01.280
The river of love is hard to cross.

43:02.590 --> 43:03.840
You must cross it yourself.

43:06.280 --> 43:07.089
A dead end...

43:07.131 --> 43:08.651
A dead end is hard to escape.

43:10.110 --> 43:11.190
Only you can save yourself.

43:32.230 --> 43:33.230
You've got a tough backbone.

43:34.440 --> 43:37.000
You actually survived
a full day of whipping.

43:41.880 --> 43:44.320
Who ordered you to kill Mr. Zheng?

43:45.070 --> 43:45.550
Speak!

43:56.760 --> 43:59.510
Was it the Crown Prince?

44:15.320 --> 44:16.320
I want to see...

44:17.510 --> 44:18.360
Lord Yu.

44:18.760 --> 44:21.400
You can just demand to see Lord Yu, huh?

44:23.280 --> 44:24.819
I'd advise you to talk now

44:24.861 --> 44:25.861
and spare yourself some pain.

44:26.590 --> 44:28.920
You might even keep your body intact.

44:30.590 --> 44:32.510
I have a secret to report to Lord Yu.

44:38.320 --> 44:39.510
If you delay something important,

44:41.190 --> 44:42.670
can you bear the consequences?

44:44.110 --> 44:45.800
If this weren't top secret,

44:46.960 --> 44:47.920
why would Princess Danyang

44:48.840 --> 44:50.670
go to such lengths to protect me?

44:52.630 --> 44:55.030
I must see Lord Yu at once.

44:56.920 --> 44:58.550
If you dare deceive me...

44:59.230 --> 45:00.760
(Lord Yu has arrived!)

45:15.340 --> 45:19.940
(Next Episode Preview)

45:26.800 --> 45:28.800
Imperial Physician Huang,
what's happening?

45:29.400 --> 45:30.819
She most likely took

45:30.861 --> 45:32.691
some dangerous medicine
to end her pregnancy.

45:32.960 --> 45:33.710
Right now,

45:34.070 --> 45:35.000
her condition is critical.

45:37.040 --> 45:40.333
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

45:43.018 --> 45:47.934
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

45:50.128 --> 45:55.973
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

45:56.473 --> 46:01.699
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

46:04.468 --> 46:09.259
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

46:10.095 --> 46:16.174
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

46:17.975 --> 46:21.125
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

46:21.125 --> 46:22.773
♪Burning bright as a song♪

46:22.825 --> 46:26.549
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

46:26.927 --> 46:31.593
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

46:32.212 --> 46:36.253
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

46:36.744 --> 46:38.859
♪Not a single hour less♪

46:38.899 --> 46:45.845
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

46:46.608 --> 46:50.061
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

46:50.241 --> 46:53.386
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

46:53.825 --> 47:00.462
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

47:00.859 --> 47:02.897
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:02.897 --> 47:05.373
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:05.411 --> 47:07.880
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:08.084 --> 47:14.971
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

47:15.283 --> 47:18.554
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

47:18.859 --> 47:22.032
♪My last untouched innocence♪

47:22.356 --> 47:25.782
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

47:26.015 --> 47:29.240
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

47:29.571 --> 47:36.367
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

47:36.736 --> 47:38.798
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:38.799 --> 47:41.302
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:41.349 --> 47:43.687
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:43.918 --> 47:50.753
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

47:51.102 --> 47:52.720
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

47:52.850 --> 47:54.646
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

47:55.003 --> 47:58.020
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:58.060 --> 47:59.387
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
